@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Ghosting: six points
Ghosting, six points, three minutes. Fast pace, all six positions. Phase two target: every rep at
the beep with a full swish, and form that holds to the last round. Split step on every call, swing
on the beep, and sprint back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
0:33 Rest. Stay engaged. Low and wide at the T.
-0:03 [countdown]
0:48 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
1:20 Rest. Feet pointing forward. Knees bent.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:35 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
2:07 Rest. Last round. Stay engaged.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:22 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
---
[stop]
